{
  "lesson": "P08",
  "goal": "Hear the three tongue positions apart (z/zh/j, c/ch/q, s/sh/x) and r, in a random mix, alone and in a row, with all four tones.",
  "items": [],
  "steps": [
    {"type": "intro", "title": "Recap: three tongue positions",
     "text": "No new sounds today. Mandarin has three tongue positions where English and German have about one:\n\n- **z c s**: tip of the tongue at the teeth. Bright and hissing.\n- **zh ch sh r**: tip curled back. Dark and hushing.\n- **j q x**: tip down, tongue flat. Soft, with a little *y* in it, like German *ich*.\n\nEach row is one sound in the three positions.",
     "rows": [["s-ze4", "s-zhe4", "s-ji4"], ["s-ce4", "s-che4", "s-qi4"], ["s-se4", "s-she4", "s-xi4"]]},
    {"type": "hear", "play": "s-zhe4", "options": ["zè", "zhè", "jì"]},
    {"type": "hear", "play": "s-qi1", "options": ["cē", "chē", "qī"]},
    {"type": "hear", "play": "s-se4", "options": ["sè", "shè", "xì"]},
    {"type": "hear", "play": "s-ji2", "options": ["zé", "zhé", "jí"]},

    {"type": "intro", "title": "s, sh or x?",
     "text": "The hissing three are the hardest to hear apart. **s** is sharp and thin, **sh** is darker and lower, **x** is soft and light, like *ich*.\n\nAnd **r** sits with sh: same curled-back tongue, but with a buzz.",
     "rows": [["s-se1", "s-she1", "s-xi1"], ["s-se3", "s-she3", "s-xi3"], ["s-she4", "s-re4"]]},
    {"type": "same", "pair": ["s-she2", "s-se2"]},
    {"type": "same", "pair": ["s-xi4", "s-xi4"]},
    {"type": "hear", "play": "s-she3", "options": ["sě", "shě", "xǐ"]},
    {"type": "hear", "play": "s-re2", "options": ["ré", "shé", "lé"]},

    {"type": "chart", "title": "Three positions",
     "text": "The tongue at the teeth, curled back and flat, in all four tones. Play the rows in pairs: ze then zhe, se then she.",
     "syllables": ["ze", "zhe", "ce", "che", "se", "she"], "tones": [1, 2, 3, 4]},
    {"type": "same", "pair": ["s-ce4", "s-che4"]},
    {"type": "same", "pair": ["s-ze1", "s-zhe1"]},
    {"type": "same", "pair": ["s-qi2", "s-qi2"]},
    {"type": "audio", "item": "s-che1", "options": ["s-ce1", "s-che1", "s-qi1"]},
    {"type": "audio", "item": "s-xi2", "options": ["s-se2", "s-she2", "s-xi2"]},
    {"type": "hear", "play": "s-ce2", "options": ["zé", "cé", "zhé", "ché"]},

    {"type": "intro", "title": "Faster: sound and tone",
     "text": "The same mix with all four tones, a bit faster. Trust your first impression.",
     "rows": [["s-zhe1", "s-ji2", "s-ze3", "s-she4"], ["s-qi1", "s-ce2", "s-xi3", "s-re4"]]},
    {"type": "tone", "play": "s-she3", "options": [1, 2, 3, 4]},
    {"type": "tone", "play": "s-ze4", "options": [1, 2, 3, 4]},
    {"type": "tone", "play": "s-qi3", "options": [1, 2, 3, 4]},
    {"type": "tone", "play": "s-re2", "options": [1, 2, 3, 4]},
    {"type": "match", "mode": "sound", "items": ["s-ze1", "s-zhe2", "s-ji3", "s-se4"]},
    {"type": "match", "mode": "sound", "items": ["s-ce1", "s-she2", "s-xi3", "s-re4"]},
    {"type": "type", "item": "s-zhe1", "from": "audio"},
    {"type": "type", "item": "s-xi4", "from": "audio"},

{"type": "intro", "title": "Three in a row",
     "text": "The three positions one after another, then mixed with other sounds and all four tones. Trust your first impression.\n\nPlay each row with ▶.",
     "rows": [["s-ze1", "s-zhe1", "s-ji1"], ["s-ce4", "s-che4", "s-qi4"], ["s-se3", "s-she3", "s-xi3"]]},
    {"type": "odd", "play": "s-zhe4", "odd": "s-ze4"},
    {"type": "odd", "play": "s-she3", "odd": "s-se3"},
    {"type": "order", "sounds": ["s-ji3", "s-ge4"], "options": ["jǐ gè", "qǐ gè", "jǐ kè", "jì gě"]},
    {"type": "order", "sounds": ["s-qi1", "s-ge4"], "options": ["qī gè", "jī gè", "qī kè", "qì gē"]},
    {"type": "order", "sounds": ["s-xi2", "s-re4"], "options": ["xí rè", "xí lè", "shé rè", "xǐ rè"]},
    {"type": "order", "sounds": ["s-ze1", "s-zhe2", "s-ji3"], "options": ["zē zhé jǐ", "zhē zé jǐ", "zē zhé qǐ", "zē jí zhě"]},
    {"type": "hear", "play": "s-re3", "options": ["rě", "lě", "shě"]},
    {"type": "same", "pair": ["s-se1", "s-xi1"]},
    {"type": "odd", "play": "s-ce2", "odd": "s-che2"},
    {"type": "tone", "play": "s-xi2", "options": [1, 2, 3, 4]},
    {"type": "order", "sounds": ["s-she4", "s-se1", "s-xi3", "s-re2"], "options": ["shè sē xǐ ré", "sè shē xǐ ré", "shè sē xì ré", "shè sē xǐ lé"]},
    {"type": "match", "mode": "sound", "items": ["s-se1", "s-xi2", "s-she3", "s-ze4"]},
    {"type": "type", "item": "s-ce3", "from": "audio"}
  ]
